  "releaseNotes": "Updated HTJ2K codec to support tlm markers and correct decompositions for .202. Disabled openjph logging.\nLinux HTJ2K codec support added\nfix Object null exception with IgnoreIconLength = true\nPassing Cancellation tokens to necessary methods\nCloseFilesAfterReading only affecting Filestreams, not other stream types\nCheck invalid length before advancing in delayed stream\nDicomException when failing to create a bitmap\nadd ReadBehaviours.AttemptToCorrectVRs. Skips private OB/OW/OF if ToleratePrivateBinaryWithUndefinedLengthAsPixels = 1 otherwise throw exception\nDon't close user passed FileStreams. \"OurFileStream\" opened using path is closed outside anyway\nWrapping other errors into DicomException\nMakeSafeCopyForDelayedLoad updated to make safe copy of any FileStream into MemStream",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "verbatimVersion": "10.0.5.3",
